1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,580
TapTab on Monad splits restaurant bills, so nobody fronts the money.

2
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:09,420
This £53.95 table is a clearly labelled local sample.

3
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:13,700
Diners claim whole items or selected shares of wine and starters.

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,540
Each pound total updates instantly.

5
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:23,500
Only volunteers share the fair remainder.

6
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,670
The table votes on the tip, then every diner approves the same split.

7
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:29,560
Any change clears consent.

8
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,570
Payment opens only after approval.

9
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:40,650
Each diner funds exactly what they owe,

10
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:44,070
or sponsors somebody else without changing the underlying obligation.

11
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:46,700
If £18.91 is still missing,

12
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,580
settlement stays locked.

13
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:51,330
Once the full £53.95 arrives,

14
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:52,840
the venue can be paid.

15
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:59,550
Stage Mode turns the same live table state

16
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:01,680
into a room-readable progress board.

17
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:07,450
The contract protects both outcomes.

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:10,050
Exact funding unlocks settlement.

19
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:13,050
Cancellation or expiry pays the venue nothing,

20
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:15,700
and opens refunds to each original contributor,

21
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:17,790
including a sponsor.

22
00:01:23,390 --> 00:01:26,850
Now switch from the £53.95 local sample

23
00:01:26,850 --> 00:01:28,310
to live evidence.

24
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:32,650
Bill 2 represents £48.50 on Monad Testnet,

25
00:01:32,650 --> 00:01:34,800
with a confirmed creation transaction.

26
00:01:35,290 --> 00:01:39,360
Monad turns claims, approvals, sponsored payments and refunds

27
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:41,900
into fast shared state for the whole table,

28
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:43,060
without a central bill keeper.

29
00:01:45,310 --> 00:01:48,050
The contract source has a Sourcify perfect match,

30
00:01:48,050 --> 00:01:49,730
and the public app is ready.

31
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,740
Scan to open live Bill 2.
